#: commands/batch-lr-unit.md:135
msgid ""
"The units are printed one after another, separated by a line of dashes. Each "
"is laid out as on the [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) page: **LAND REGISTRY "
"UNIT**, then **PARCEL LIST (SHEET A)**, **OWNERSHIP SHEET (LIST B)** and "
"**ENCUMBRANCES SHEET (LIST C)**. A unit with pending entries carries the same"
" **Pending entries (plombe)** line and warning."
msgstr ""

#: commands/batch-lr-unit.md:144
msgid ""
"To continue from a batch-fetch result, use `--from-batch-output` with the "
"JSON file it wrote:"
msgstr ""

#: commands/batch-lr-unit.md:151
msgid ""
"For a long list, screen output is hard to read. Keep it as a file instead "
"with `--format json` and `--output`:"
msgstr ""

